{"name": "Millennium Slumber", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive 400,000 years on a planet infested with an alien calamity! Gather resources, build a base, and protect your cryostasis machine against hordes of nocturnal monsters in this sci-fi base building, top down shooter roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you adapt to survive millennia of evolution?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras_big/18daecafdd1e49124976024704bcefe3.webp?t=1787849218\" height=\"334\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/18daecafdd1e49124976024704bcefe3.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/3c77578c0dd4a04b3e1a344c5ff3dde3.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find resources across a randomly generated planet: plants, scrap metal, weird sentient crystals, everything can be used to survive. Resources can be collected in different ways: blow up a spaceship for some scrap metal, harvest your glowing potted plant, kill an alien dragon to get its eyes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"354\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/4b0fde6153339fc839f4631ff8aaf726.poster.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"348\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/4b0fde6153339fc839f4631ff8aaf726.webm?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/4b0fde6153339fc839f4631ff8aaf726.mp4?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"354\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/b0702a9cba741b12f28e9fa9aee23c6a.poster.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"348\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/b0702a9cba741b12f28e9fa9aee23c6a.webm?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/b0702a9cba741b12f28e9fa9aee23c6a.mp4?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/3b569eecdc648078e4ec61d6e3d2849d.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a base to protect your only way to survive through millennia: the cryostasis machine. Turrets, traps, mining drills, decoys... each building has its unique behaviour!  Obtain new blueprints across your runs and experiment to find the best way to repel all the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"484\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/5f69ad649895e4796cc8eb9d88d6827f.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"706\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"776\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/11811debfed3f9b19e939d7eac495ee5.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"1556\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/48240c934dcb40ee0551d157c8b15e8a.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the night has come, it's you, your base, and the monsters. Will you survive until sunrise? What would you do when the Forever Night will come?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use everything you have to repel the alien abominations for the next hundred thousand years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"484\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/a852daf9b40fbba441973b69d2bd4dc4.poster.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"914\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/a852daf9b40fbba441973b69d2bd4dc4.webm?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/a852daf9b40fbba441973b69d2bd4dc4.mp4?t=1787849218\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/ce711d6adc2b2ef5dac0a53951f47f6c.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the planet is safe, enter cryostasis for a hundred thousand years nap. Climate change, evolution of species, meteorites, new civilizations... Who knows what the planets will be like when you'll wake up? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can your actions change the future of this planet?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/extras/eca2ce1d09a4b96d4be4f7b5aed1603e.avif?t=1787849218\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We think you will like Millennium Slumber if you like these games: Don't Starve, Wizard with a Gun, Cult of the Lamb.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Survive 400,000 years on a planet infested with an alien calamity! Gather resources, build a base and defend against hordes of nocturnal monsters in this rogue-like with cryostasis mechanics.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174420/0ae77116905894857bed8bcb154dd26ed552ba7b/header.jpg?t=1787849218", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Survival", "Open World Survival Craft", "Crafting", "Indie", "Singleplayer", "2D"], "developers": "Desmodus Games", "publishers": "Desmodus Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4174420", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "31 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/hbTz6tIz3JI", "first_seen": 1788127200.0, "review_rank": 9}